                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b29f09d3-ed99-3e1e-9df7-1f6cb29589d7",
                        "entry_id": "9c00ec6b-b185-3cf7-a9d1-99361cbbf688",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. связанный, соотносящийся по значению с существительным корреляция; находящийся во взаимной зависимости; соотносительный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9a7ebfbe-a173-4e6b-a13c-54c2250b3fa3",
                        "source_entry_id": "9c00ec6b-b185-3cf7-a9d1-99361cbbf688",
                        "source_sense_id": "b29f09d3-ed99-3e1e-9df7-1f6cb29589d7",
                        "target_lang_word": "correlative",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "correlative",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1c02e365-90ce-3e05-accf-44ee23fff60b",
                                        "entry_id": "fbbb809b-6e51-329d-b606-f6e3bb611bac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mutually related; corresponding."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6bdc44d4-3e51-4d68-99b9-0d8f4ee8ec0d",
                                                "sense_id": "1c02e365-90ce-3e05-accf-44ee23fff60b",
                                                "text": "If we reinterpret these phenomena in terms of a consistently game-playing model of behavior, the need to distinguish between primary and secondary gains disappears. The correlative necessity to estimate the relative significance of physiological needs and dammed-up impulses on the one hand, and of social and interpersonal factors on the other, also vanishes. Since needs and impulses cannot be said to exist in human social life without specified rules for dealing with them, instinctual needs cannot be considered solely in terms of biological rules, but must also be viewed in terms of their psychosocial significance—that is, as parts of the game."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "correlative",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83e8e57d-14a3-3074-94b4-63ee66e63802",
                                        "entry_id": "674b903f-f386-30ed-91c9-ba1ae66031f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Either of two correlative things."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "formal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88d56417-f899-46be-88b6-d9971e2d878d",
                                                "sense_id": "83e8e57d-14a3-3074-94b4-63ee66e63802",
                                                "text": "The actual motivation for this separation was a curious mixture of arrogance and respect: the new arrogance of the administrators abroad who faced 'backward populations' or 'lower breeds' found its correlative in the respect of old-fashioned statesmen at home who felt that no nation had the right to impose its law upon a foreign people."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "757b0456-0524-3b17-9b99-38f3d675c3f7",
                                        "entry_id": "674b903f-f386-30ed-91c9-ba1ae66031f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pro-form; a non-personal pronominal, proadjectival, or proadverbial form"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c7b03642-9aab-4aad-869e-6d825dbb23f9",
                        "source_entry_id": "9c00ec6b-b185-3cf7-a9d1-99361cbbf688",
                        "source_sense_id": "b29f09d3-ed99-3e1e-9df7-1f6cb29589d7",
                        "target_lang_word": "correlativo",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "correlativo",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72e2ab23-6bc6-32a5-b984-a934e68e9064",
                                        "entry_id": "92d8a1e8-5783-33bd-a492-06e68cadaed0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Que tiene con otro u otros una relación de sucesión inmediata, correspondencia o influencia recíproca, de tal modo que los evoca en una serie lógica."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "generalmente en plural para referirse",
                                            "dos",
                                            "más personas",
                                            "cosas"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a66623b9-d0f0-4f4b-ad9d-f5665459c2e2",
                                                "sense_id": "72e2ab23-6bc6-32a5-b984-a934e68e9064",
                                                "text": "* Los adverbios \"aquí\" y \"allá\" son correlativos en la indicación de lugar."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22c280f5-a1cb-4b59-8363-3c31be2d183d",
                                                "sense_id": "72e2ab23-6bc6-32a5-b984-a934e68e9064",
                                                "text": "* El talento y la suerte son factores correlativos para obtener un buen ingreso."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b005774c-6b0d-4511-aa61-bed1c09b98a9",
                                                "sense_id": "72e2ab23-6bc6-32a5-b984-a934e68e9064",
                                                "text": "Los términos \"tanto.como...\" se usan de manera correlativa."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7956d6aa-dc1f-335f-97a1-2a423a477204",
                                        "entry_id": "92d8a1e8-5783-33bd-a492-06e68cadaed0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dicho de una materia: que es necesario tenerla aprobada para poder cursar otra."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f976aed2-00c1-469f-ae10-b6dad26887ab",
                        "source_entry_id": "9c00ec6b-b185-3cf7-a9d1-99361cbbf688",
                        "source_sense_id": "b29f09d3-ed99-3e1e-9df7-1f6cb29589d7",
                        "target_lang_word": "correlativo",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "51cbcc39-b0f6-4cb2-9b2c-2cb949bb2255",
                        "source_entry_id": "9c00ec6b-b185-3cf7-a9d1-99361cbbf688",
                        "source_sense_id": "b29f09d3-ed99-3e1e-9df7-1f6cb29589d7",
                        "target_lang_word": "corrélatif",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "corrélatif",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c4dea964-831c-3a5b-bcc4-c853d92167b0",
                                        "entry_id": "22aca4b3-999c-3c6a-91b0-0d94018c1ff8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui marque entre deux termes une relation telle que l’un des deux appelle logiquement l’autre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Didactique"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "013c92ab-e826-4021-8a8f-66552f00d04a",
                                                "sense_id": "c4dea964-831c-3a5b-bcc4-c853d92167b0",
                                                "text": "Ce que nous venons de dire suppose que l’exégèse et l’eiségèse sont corrélatives, comme la montée et la descente d'un même chemin. Il ne serait pas nécessaire d’inventer le mot \"eiségèse\" si l’exégèse n'avait la prétention d'être seulement une \"sortie\" à partir du texte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a44e9a0-73f4-4622-9722-680198975be9",
                                                "sense_id": "c4dea964-831c-3a5b-bcc4-c853d92167b0",
                                                "text": "Cette nouvelle doctrine doit rester en cohérence avec l’objectif de réduction des surfaces utilisées par l’État, qui permet d’infléchir les dépenses de location, d’entretien et de rénovation associées, et qui constitue également un puissant levier pour réduire son impact environnemental, avec la diminution corrélative des consommations énergétiques."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "767b5c4e-823e-3100-80df-c39980779284",
                                        "entry_id": "22aca4b3-999c-3c6a-91b0-0d94018c1ff8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Se dit des mots qui vont ordinairement ensemble et qui servent à indiquer une certaine relation entre deux membres de phrase, comme « tellement » et « que »."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "157d6576-0963-4431-b41b-9c8a7fe07c61",
                                                "sense_id": "767b5c4e-823e-3100-80df-c39980779284",
                                                "text": "Deux propositions se succèdent, la première comporte un mot en qu-, la seconde un élément corrélatif en t-"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "corrélatif",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c280ecbf-dbd5-3271-ad9e-958ba3d80021",
                                        "entry_id": "b004bede-4c99-3215-bbcc-0c02d08ebedf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mot qui est corrélatif d'un autre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "efa831be-a7b4-4c1b-a943-29b5586b0ba2",
                                                "sense_id": "c280ecbf-dbd5-3271-ad9e-958ba3d80021",
                                                "text": "La seconde grande fonction de is est d'être, par excellence, le corrélatif du relatif à l'époque archaïque et classique."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
